WEBVTT

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:10.930
Oxford bookworms, stage 1 The President's murderer by Jennifer

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:24.410
Bassett, read by Nicolette Mackenzie The first day run the

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:28.370
man thought move faster

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:36.550
I can't stop now over the man's head the night

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:41.350
sky was black and cold and in

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:50.150
front of him were the trees tall dark trees 500

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:55.410
meters away I can hide there

00:00:55.460 --> 00:01:04.110
