00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:46.750
but he did faster and faster the trees were a

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:55.290
hundred meters away 50 20 and then

00:02:55.340 --> 00:03:02.830
he was there the trees opened their dark arms to

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:07.390
him but he did not stop running

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:14.630
