00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:43.610
ground now he

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:52.270
half sat half stood in the tree and listened nothing

00:06:52.320 --> 00:07:04.350
an hour he thought sleep for an hour then go

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.650
on go

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:19.310
south hide in the day and move at night I

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:30.450
can get there in five days perhaps six the man

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.470
put his

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:42.970
down on his arms and slept what are you saying

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:51.470
you lost him the chief of police said angrily the

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:57.690
young police inspector in front of her was tired very

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:04.250
tired he wanted to sit down but people did not

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:21.450
sit down in the

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:31.190
not before so the inspector stood I'm sorry chief he

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:37.930
said we couldn't find him in the trees we looked

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:44.350
all night but it was dark and the chief of

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:52.150
police put her hands on the desk in front of her you had

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:59.870
five men with you inspector and two dogs and you

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:04.690
couldn't find him either

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:11.570
behind the chief of police was a tall woman of

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:20.670
about fifty her eyes were gray and very cold dangerous

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:30.310
eyes when either

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:38.750
did not ask questions first the inspector waited and the

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:45.430
chief of police looked at him coldly what are you

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:54.830
waiting for she asked go out and find him three

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:58.550
months ago this man Alex

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:06.270
dean on killed the president of our country he's a

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:14.950
murderer a dangerous man 24 hours ago he escaped from

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:20.910
prison and our new president wants him back in prison

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:25.990
today now at once

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:35.770
the inspector quickly left the room his name was Felix

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:43.390
and he was 33 years old that was young for

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:49.970
an inspector but he was a good policeman he liked

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:53.870
his job and worked long hours

00:10:53.920 --> 00:11:01.190
but he was sometimes afraid of Eva Heine the chief

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:08.890
of police ten minutes later he was back in his

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:18.010
office and Adam came into his room Adam was 25

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:23.860
and usually worked with Felix on important jobs

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:34.270
what did the chief say Adam asked find dean on

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:43.450
quickly Felix said so let's begin have we got photographs

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:49.040
of dean on and what about his family

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:58.290
Adam put some photographs on the desk he's got a

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:07.650
wife and two young children he said right I want

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:11.960
photographs on television and in all the newspapers

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:19.690
four men can watch his house and family day and

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:29.210
night four hours on and four hours off next I

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:38.170
want policemen at all the airports and telephones rang and

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:38.930
people came

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:45.610
and went in the office Felix and Adam worked on

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:49.300
late into the night

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:19.350
the second day the next morning Alex Denon was 40

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:26.570
kilometers south of the prison he moved quickly and stayed

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:33.570
away from towns and villages it was winter and the

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:34.860
weather was cold

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:41.950
so there were not many people in the fields he

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:49.130
looked behind him often but nobody saw him and nobody

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.440
followed him

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:58.430
at midday he found a quiet field and lay down

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:04.980
under some small trees he slept at once

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:14.250
at about three o'clock Alex opened his eyes and

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:18.620
saw an old woman in front of him

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:26.990
what are you doing in my field young man she

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:34.750
said Alex sat up quickly I'm sorry he said

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:42.330
I was tired and needed some sleep I'm going now

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:51.000
you're very dirty the old woman said look at you

00:14:52.160 --> 00:15:00.550
where are you going north Alex said he stood up

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:10.710
and began to move away don't run away I'm only

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.040
an old woman

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:22.430
she looked at him carefully you're dirty and hungry and

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:41.970
tired and afraid am I right

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:48.650
in my house and have some food and you can

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:56.230
have some of my husband's old clothes he died last

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:57.320
winter

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:05.630
Alex looked at her it was true he was hungry

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:14.330
and tired and dirty and afraid but not of this

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:15.380
old woman

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:24.790
thank you very much he said the old woman's name

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:45.270
was Marta her house was very small but she

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:54.390
were hungry she laughed Alex smiled but did not stop

00:16:54.440 --> 00:17:01.750
eating Marta found some old clothes for him and then

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:03.390
made some

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:10.230
coffee she said nothing but watched him with a smile

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:19.590
Alex finished eating and drank some coffee he began to

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:20.520
feel better

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:31.430
how did you escape from prison Marta asked suddenly Alex's

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:50.500
face went white he stared at Marta and said nothing

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:57.170
you can stay here tonight Alex Dean on and have

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:04.630
a good sleep I don't like the police and I'm

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.640
not going to tell them

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:16.310
Felix and Adam did not get much sleep they stayed

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:23.670
in the office and slept between telephone calls the phones

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:24.960
rang often

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:31.030
but in the morning there was no news of Alex

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:38.990
Dean on the day went slowly the phones rang again

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:44.060
and again but there was no news

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:52.450
where is he what's he doing Felix said to Adam

00:18:52.500 --> 00:19:02.230
he's hiding perhaps with friends we questioned all his friends

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:05.880
early this morning Adam said

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:16.550
they said nothing he looked at Felix can we bring

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:24.370
some of them in here with their wives then we

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:28.380
can ask more difficult questions

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:39.690
somebody usually talks then no Felix said coldly that's not

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:47.040
right and you know it Dean on can't get out of the country now

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:54.350
but we need to find him today the chief isn't

00:19:54.400 --> 00:20:02.030
going to be very happy late in the afternoon the chief of police

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:09.430
telephone come to my office in half an hour she

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:19.330
told Felix Felix felt tired and dirty he quickly drank

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:23.620
some black coffee and changed his shirt

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:31.390
20 minutes later he stood in front of Eva Heinz

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:40.070
desk she did not smile but looked at Felix and

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:40.600
waited

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:48.850
the police are looking for Dean on in every town

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:55.950
and village Felix said quickly we are watching the roads

00:20:56.000 --> 00:21:02.150
and the airports and the houses of his family and

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:09.540
friends sit down inspector and listen the chief said

00:21:10.780 --> 00:21:16.730
we need to find this man quickly the president is

00:21:16.780 --> 00:21:25.110
not happy you're a good policeman inspector and this is

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:27.300
an important job for you

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:35.270
chief Felix began how did dean on escape from prison

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:43.310
that's not important now the chief said but perhaps he

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:46.780
had friends in prison Felix said

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:53.050
perhaps they know something I need to talk to people

00:21:53.100 --> 00:22:01.490
at the prison well you can't the chief said the

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:04.440
telephone rang on the chief's desk

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:13.570
she picked up the phone Eva Heinz here then she

00:22:13.620 --> 00:22:22.470
smiled yes mr. President she said she listened for a

00:22:22.520 --> 00:22:23.380
minute or two

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:37.030
yes of course mr. President I understand yes goodbye Eva

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:42.120
Heinz put the phone down and looked at Felix angrily

00:22:43.560 --> 00:22:49.310
forget Dean on's escape from prison get out there and

00:22:49.360 --> 00:22:57.090
find him and bring him back dead or alive at

00:22:57.140 --> 00:23:12.050
the door Felix turned and looked at her

00:23:12.100 --> 00:23:20.050
now go Felix walked slowly back to his office there

00:23:20.100 --> 00:23:25.760
were a lot of questions in his head and he did not know the answers

00:23:27.940 --> 00:23:32.650
why can't I talk to people at the prison he

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:38.070
thought what did the president say to the chief on

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:43.610
the phone and why does she want dean on dead

00:23:43.660 --> 00:23:49.410
he went to prison because he murdered the old president

00:23:49.460 --> 00:23:52.520
everybody knows that

00:23:53.580 --> 00:23:57.780
what can he talk about now

00:24:26.360 --> 00:24:27.710
now

00:24:27.760 --> 00:24:31.910
and the next morning Marta put a big breakfast on

00:24:31.960 --> 00:24:41.030
the table Alex at Hungary and Marta talked what's happening

00:24:41.080 --> 00:24:48.470
to this country she said I don't know I didn't

00:24:48.520 --> 00:24:54.400
like the old president he was old and stupid

00:24:55.680 --> 00:25:01.330
there's never much food in the shops when did I

00:25:01.380 --> 00:25:09.130
last eat some good meat she said angrily I work

00:25:09.180 --> 00:25:18.150
every day and what do I get nothing what do

00:25:18.200 --> 00:25:24.330
you think about

00:25:24.380 --> 00:25:30.990
oh he's worse he's a younger man and he's not

00:25:31.040 --> 00:25:39.270
stupid but he's more dangerous he's very friendly with the

00:25:39.320 --> 00:25:46.700
police and the army and he's putting a lot of people in prison

00:25:48.120 --> 00:25:54.250
that's not good for the country we want more food

00:25:54.300 --> 00:26:01.870
