00:26:58.080 --> 00:27:05.410
the police always have a friend in every village Alex

00:27:05.460 --> 00:27:13.970
said sadly Marta I'm going now at once the police

00:27:14.020 --> 00:27:17.290
are going to be here soon and ha

00:27:17.340 --> 00:27:24.310
Marta said angrily I'm not afraid of the police or

00:27:24.360 --> 00:27:32.810
their questions Alex Dean on who's he is he somebody

00:27:32.860 --> 00:27:37.120
on television Alex smiled

00:27:38.600 --> 00:27:46.650
you're a wonderful woman Marta he said goodbye and thank

00:27:46.700 --> 00:27:54.170
you Marta looked at Alex and her old face was

00:27:54.220 --> 00:27:55.880
