00:28:18.460 --> 00:28:23.980
house he thought about Marta and smiled

00:28:24.980 --> 00:28:33.790
boy he was 33 years old and a dangerous murderer

00:28:33.840 --> 00:28:41.280
but to Marta he was only a tired and hungry boy

00:28:45.300 --> 00:28:48.670
at eight o'clock in the morning of the third

00:28:48.720 --> 00:28:56.830
day the telephone rang on Felix's desk Felix listened then

00:28:56.880 --> 00:28:58.620
put the phone down quickly

00:29:00.120 --> 00:29:06.750
Adam he shouted we've got him he's in a village

00:29:06.800 --> 00:29:13.770
up north in an old woman's house come on let's

00:29:13.820 --> 00:29:21.600
go the big police car was fast and the kilometers went quickly

00:29:22.760 --> 00:29:28.950
Adam was tired and wanted to sleep but Felix wanted

00:29:29.000 --> 00:29:35.550
to talk I saw the chief again last night he

00:29:35.600 --> 00:29:38.840
said she's getting angry

00:29:39.740 --> 00:29:44.610
I was in her office and the president phoned her

00:29:44.660 --> 00:29:53.190
they want Dean on badly dead or alive why do

00:29:53.240 --> 00:29:54.540
they want him dead?

00:29:55.880 --> 00:30:04.630
I don't know Adam said let's find him first in

00:30:04.680 --> 00:30:09.540
Marta's village a policeman stood at the door of her house

00:30:11.020 --> 00:30:16.330
we looked all through the house and there's nobody in

00:30:16.380 --> 00:30:39.470
there he said only Marta the old woman and she's

00:30:39.520 --> 00:30:40.470
not talking

00:30:40.520 --> 00:30:48.150
what an exciting day listen to the inspector Adam said

00:30:48.200 --> 00:30:53.060
angrily he wants to ask you some questions

00:30:55.020 --> 00:31:03.230
Felix sat down and smiled at Marta now Marta he

00:31:03.280 --> 00:31:10.140
said somebody saw a young man in your house yesterday

00:31:11.140 --> 00:31:18.250
who was he Marta and where did he go he

00:31:18.300 --> 00:31:25.510
was my sister's youngest son Marta said happily he's a

00:31:25.560 --> 00:31:27.200
very nice boy

00:31:27.820 --> 00:31:37.070
the policeman whispered in Felix's ear Felix looked sadly at

00:31:37.120 --> 00:31:45.850
Marta your sister and all her family live in Australia

00:31:45.900 --> 00:31:47.200
Marta

00:31:48.200 --> 00:31:55.470
who was the man in your house oh dear Marta

00:31:55.520 --> 00:32:02.470
said I'm an old woman you know 72 last month

00:32:02.520 --> 00:32:06.500
I forget things very easily

00:32:07.500 --> 00:32:16.610
in Australia did you say Felix asked question after question

00:32:16.660 --> 00:32:24.830
but Marta told him nothing sometimes the young man in

00:32:24.880 --> 00:32:28.060
her house was her sister's son

00:32:29.060 --> 00:32:34.250
sometimes he was the young doctor from the next village

00:32:34.300 --> 00:32:41.080
but he was never Alex Denon the president's murderer

00:32:43.020 --> 00:32:49.930
Adam got very angry and whispered to Felix can I

00:32:49.980 --> 00:32:54.920
ask the questions no Felix said

00:32:55.920 --> 00:33:02.250
he did not like Adam's questions he stood up and

00:33:02.300 --> 00:33:09.120
moved to the door but Marta now wanted to ask him a question

00:33:11.100 --> 00:33:15.590
and why do you work for the police young man

00:33:15.640 --> 00:33:22.230
the police always put the wrong people in prison you

00:33:22.280 --> 00:33:24.070
know

00:33:24.120 --> 00:33:33.710
Marta Felix said tiredly Alex Denon is a murderer he

00:33:33.760 --> 00:33:41.450
murdered oh I know that Marta said the newspapers said

00:33:41.500 --> 00:33:42.080
that

00:33:43.080 --> 00:33:49.410
but newspapers and the television never tell us the true

00:33:49.460 --> 00:33:57.910
story Alex Denon isn't a murderer he's a nice young

00:33:57.960 --> 00:34:01.920
man a nice young man

00:34:02.920 --> 00:34:09.410
Felix said quickly how do you know that he's got

00:34:09.460 --> 00:34:16.580
a nice face that's why I saw his picture on the television

00:34:17.940 --> 00:34:23.890
I'm an old woman and I can read people's faces

00:34:23.940 --> 00:34:31.620
so who did murder the president then Felix asked

00:34:33.100 --> 00:34:41.410
I don't know Marta said you're the policeman you go

00:34:41.460 --> 00:34:46.490
and find the murderer but I can tell you one

00:34:46.540 --> 00:34:54.610
thing you can begin with the new president he's got

00:34:54.660 --> 00:35:16.470
a murderer's face Adam said angrily that's dangerous

00:35:16.520 --> 00:35:25.770
Adam said stupid old woman yes Felix said perhaps she

00:35:25.820 --> 00:35:30.740
was and perhaps she wasn't

