01:09:39.990 --> 01:09:47.160
then he looked away out of the window after a

01:09:47.210 --> 01:09:51.200
minute or two he stood up and went to the

01:09:51.250 --> 01:09:58.350
door then he turned and looked at the chief of police

01:10:01.210 --> 01:10:07.400
I'd like to know the murderer's name he said quietly

01:10:07.450 --> 01:10:14.730
and I'm going to find it he opened the door

01:10:16.810 --> 01:10:24.100
goodbye chief he went out and closed the door behind

01:10:24.150 --> 01:10:45.370
him for the last time you
